                "text": "This National EMS Week, I\u2019m sending my deepest thanks to the emergency medical professionals serving southern New Mexico. From rural clinics to border towns, your commitment saves lives every day. I\u2019m fighting to protect access to Narcan and ensure you have the tools you need to keep our communities safe. Thank you for all you do.",
