                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I visited the New Mexico State Veterans' Home in Truth or Consequences to see the top-notch facilities our veterans enjoy thanks to investments from our state leaders. I also spoke with the mayors of Truth or Consequences and Elephant Butte and we discussed housing, health care, water issues and how to strengthen the local economy.\nSierra County is a jewel in the Southwest.",
