                "text": "On the third anniversary of the Dobbs decision that overturned Roe v. Wade, I\u2019m proud to co-sponsor the Women\u2019s Health Protection Act. Every American deserves the freedom to make their own private medical decisions without fear, shame, or criminalization. https://t.co/qwBfan2xBD",
