                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Family, medical, and business trips at our small airports keep rural New Mexico connected. I\u2019m bringing federal dollars home to rebuild runways in Alamogordo and Hatch, bring improvements to Socorro, and restore Silver City\u2019s airport lot. These investments mean safer travel, stronger local economies, and better service for Southern New Mexico.",
