                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "America can do better than this terrible bill. Every hardworking family will feel the pain thanks to Republicans. Here's how:\n- $4 trillion increase in national debt\n- 17 million Americans lose health care \n- 8 NM hospitals at risk of closing \n- $250/year more in household energy prices\n- Biggest ever cut in food assistance for families, kids, veterans \n- 1 in 4 nursing homes will close\n- Millions of manufacturing and construction jobs destroyed",
