                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Every year, Congress passes the NDAA\u2014a bill that shapes our national defense priorities. I\u2019m ensuring New Mexicans\u2019 needs are at the forefront of the conversation. That means making sure military families can access the health care they deserve and honoring Downwinders with long-overdue recognition.",
