                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans say their tax bill supports working families\u2014but when you look closer, you\u2019ll see that it just makes life more expensive, gutting funding for health care, food assistance, and the programs our communities rely on. If you work hard, you should be able to afford a home, feed your family, and build a future right here in New Mexico.",
