                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I met with Somos un Pueblo Unido and local energy workers to discuss the dangerous health conditions they face on the job. While executives rake in millions in profits, it's workers who truly power New Mexico. That's why I introduced the Energy Workers Health Improvement and Compensation Act \u2014 to ensure workers can access the care they need.",
